# Leyline addresses, in one place (docs/DOMAIN-MOVE.md; the same list is tools/domain/addresses.json in the repo).
# The website is https://<domain>, the browser game https://play.<domain>, the relay relay.<domain>, join pages
# https://relay.<domain>/join/<realm id>. Read by wunet/domains.py (setup, agent, relay) and the bash scripts
# (leyline, host-wrath-realm.sh).
LEYLINE_DOMAIN=leylinelauncher.com
# The names before the move (1 Nov 2026). They answer forever: a host pack that can't reach a new name tries these.
LEYLINE_OLD_SITE=https://play.openvanilla.app
LEYLINE_OLD_GAME=https://wrath.openvanilla.app
LEYLINE_OLD_RELAY=relay.openvanilla.app
